## Why This Is Asked
Tests CSS-only interactive patterns, accessibility fundamentals, and responsive layout skills without relying on JavaScript.

## Key Concepts
- CSS Grid for responsive card layouts with `repeat(2, 1fr)`
- Radio/label toggle patterns for pure-CSS tab switching
- `focus-visible` outlines for keyboard accessibility
- `prefers-reduced-motion` media query for motion sensitivity

